\]

Substituting \( E_p = \hbar \omega_p \), the cross section becomes:

\[
\sigma = \frac{2 \pi^2 \hbar^2}{ m_e^2 } \frac{\Gamma_p}{ E_p } \left ( \frac{E_0}{ E_F } \right )^2 \left ( 1 - \frac{E_0}{ E_F } \right )^2 \left ( \frac{ E_p}{ E_0 + E_p } \right )^2
\]

