\]  

Thus, the uncertainty in the energy is approximately \(5.0 \times 10^{23} \text{ MeV}\).  

The typical range of outcomes for measurements would be:  
\[
E \pm \Delta E = 1385 \text{ MeV} \pm 5.0 \times 10^{23} \text{ MeV}
\]  

