   \[
   n = \frac{1}{Z} e^{-\frac{E - \mu}{kT)}}
   \]
   where \(Z\) is the partition function, \(\mu\) is the chemical potential, \(T\) is the temperature, and \(k\) is the Boltzmann constant.

